2. Resource allocation constraint for campaign X: Ensures that the number of resource units allocated to campaign X is at least twice as many as those allocated to campaign Y plus an additional 300 units.

The objective function is set to minimize the total cost, which is the sum of the number of resource units allocated to each campaign multiplied by their respective costs.

Finally, the script solves the model and outputs the minimum total cost and the optimal resource allocation. If an optimal solution is found, it prints the results; otherwise, it indicates that no optimal solution was found.

