The objective function is to minimize the sum of production and inventory costs, which is calculated using the `cp.quicksum` function.

The constraints include demand satisfaction for each quarter and production capacity constraints. Demand satisfaction for each quarter is ensured by the equation `i_{t-1} + p_t + o_t - i_t = demand_t`, where `i_{t-1}` is the inventory level at the end of the previous quarter. Production capacity constraints ensure that the number of sailboats produced using regular-time labor during each quarter does not exceed 40.

Finally, the script solves the model and outputs the minimum sum of production and inventory costs as well as the optimal production schedule.

