Using this model, we can apply linear programming techniques to find the optimal number of times each process should be performed to maximize the amount of metal extracted while satisfying the constraints of water and pollution. This will provide a strategy for optimizing resource allocation and environmental impact.

## Python Code Solution Using `coptpy`:
