  - This represents the initial inventory level at the beginning of January.

Using this model, we can apply linear programming techniques to find the optimal production and inventory plan that minimizes the total costs while meeting the demand for each month. This will provide Basel Tool and Die Company with an economically efficient production and inventory strategy.

## Python Code Solution Using `coptpy`:
