- Minimize the time required to meet the weekly demand: \[Z = \max\left(\frac{120}{\sum_{i=1}^{5} x_{i1}}, \frac{150}{\sum_{i=1}^{5} x_{i2}}, \frac{200}{\sum_{i=1}^{5} x_{i3}}\right)\]
